  "reasoning": "The defendant caused a forest fire while performing a ritual (sweeping a tomb) and using fire carelessly, leading to the burning of forest land. The case is analogous to other examples where accidental or negligent fires are labeled as “失火”. There is no indication of intent to set fire, so the appropriate charge is 失火.",
